{"id":395,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"知性・自主自立・創造を育む6年間の一貫教育","feature_description":"横浜市立南高等学校附属中学校は「知性・自主自立・創造」を教育理念とし、学びへの探究心、自ら考え行動する力、未来を切り拓く力を育てます。6年間の一貫教育で基礎学力と国際的な視野を培い、質の高い学習や生徒同士の切磋琢磨を通じて、社会で活躍するリーダーを目指します。教育課程では基礎基本と、思考力・判断力・表現力を重視した学習を行い、国際社会で活躍する力につなげます。","clubs":[{"id":7401,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7402,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7403,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7404,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7405,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7406,"name":"バドミントン（1年女子　2、3年男女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7407,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7408,"name":"ハンドボール（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7409,"name":"硬式テニス（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7410,"name":"演劇","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"